      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00958",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“已经三点了吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is it already three o'clock?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00958",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "大概从宴会回来，一躺倒就那么睡着了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I must have come back from the banquet and fallen asleep as soon as I lay down.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00958",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我同朋友约好了，所以她们才来邀我的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had made plans with my friends, so that is why they came to invite me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00958",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "她们准以为我上哪儿去了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "They must think I have gone off somewhere.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
